# Large generated/vendored trees. These are already ignored by
# stats4roi/.gitignore for git's purposes; they are repeated here because some
# tools (e.g. the context-engine indexer) read only the top-level ignore file,
# and without these they walk ~21k vendored files instead of ~215 source files.
